[11/14 15:45:27     11s]         # DATA  @ 10c    : 0.3%
[11/14 15:45:27     11s]         # CLOCK @ 20.3mV : 3.5%
[11/14 15:45:27     11s]         # CLOCK @ 10c    : 0.2%
[11/14 15:45:27     11s] 
[11/14 15:45:27     11s]         # For setup only derate clock
